# Intentionally no SPA catch-all.
# All 30 routes are prerendered and Cloudflare Pages resolves clean URLs to
# them directly; a `/* /index.html 200` rule would instead answer every typo
# and stale link with the homepage under a 200, which is a soft 404.
# Unmatched paths now fall through to dist/404.html with a real 404 status.
